{
  "id": "ISA.60",
  "number": "60",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 60",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "60",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 60"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "60",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai, rieny; kum der peri bino, man der pa Yehova wok i wii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum, nen, mudho biumo ng’om, man mudho ma bii biumo kodhidhanu; ento Yehova bilero wii, man dwong’ pare binen i wii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man thek bibino ba der peri, man ju m’ubimo ba der mi rupiny peri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ting’ weng’i gbur, man inen: kagi ceke gicokri karacelo, gibino i beng’i; woti biai ku bor, man jubiyeyo nyigi ku bot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibilund neno man ibirieny, e adundeni bimiel man ebidoko dit; kum dit mi nam bilokre i beng’i, lonyo mi thek bibino i beng’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udul mi ngamia biumi, ngamia m’aradu mi Midian man Efa; gin ceke m’uai i Ceba bibino; gibikelo mola ma kwar kud udok ma ng’wice ng’ar, man gibiyero pi pak pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udul rombe ceke mi Kedar bicokre karacelo i beng’i, nyogi rombe mi Nebaioth bitimo iri; gibiidho malu ma giyire wi pemblam para; man abiyungo ot mi dwong’ para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni ng’a m’uringo calu afuru, man calu akurubawang’ udigi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andha cula bikura, man combo mi Tarcic ma kwong’ane, kara gikel woti ku bor, mola ma tar migi ku mola ma kwar migi karacelo kugi, pi nying’ Yehova Mungu peri, man pi Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, kum eyungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man juwirok bigomo gang’kidi peri, man ju m’ubimo migi bitimo iri: kum agoi i kwinyo para, ento kisa nega i kumi i bero para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 21:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhugang’ peri bende bibedo ayaba thiri thiri; jubicikogi dieceng’ kadi diewor de ngo; kara dhanu kel lonyo mi thek i beng’i, man ju m’ubimo migi ma jupeyo ni ng’eca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum thek kadi ker maeno ma bitimo iri ngo binyothre; eyo, jubinyotho thek maeno kot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwong’ mi Lebanon bibino i beng’i, sipre, ku sipre ma ithe boco, ku yen ma dundo karacelo, kara ulony ka mi kamaleng’ para; man abidwoko ka mi tienda ni ka dwong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 3:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot ju m’usendi bibino aruma i beng’i; man dhanu ceke m’ucei birum gigi the tiendi; e gibilwong’i kumae, Adhura pa Yehova, man, Sayuni pa Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ebedo nia juweki man judegi, ketho nia ng’atu moko kadhu ngo kudii, abidwoki ni dwong’ mi nja, ni mutoro ni dhanum’utuk dupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibidhodho cak mi thek bende, man ibidhodho thuno mi ju m’ubimo; man ibing’eyo nia an, an a Yehova, an a Jalarni, man Jawarni, ma Ng’atu Matek pa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abikelo mola ma kwar ka mola, man abikelo mola ma tar ka nyunyu, man mola ka yen, man nyunyu ka kidi. Abidwoko jego peri bende ni kwiocwiny, man weg ajok peri ni bedopwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubiwinjo pi rop kendo ngo i ng’om peri, kadi uvuru kadi nyoth yor i kieu peri; ento ibilwong’o gang’kidi peri Both, man dhugang’ peri Pak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceng’ bibedo der peri kendo ngo ku dieceng’; kadi dwi de bimio iri der mi rieny ungo: ento Yehova bibedo iri ni der mi nja, man Mungu peri bibedo ni dwong’ peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceng’ peri bimwony kendo ngo, kadok dwi peri de biai ngo; kum Yehova bibedo der peri mi nja, man ceng’ mi ywak peri bithum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanu peri bende bibedo pwe ceke; gibicamu ng’om ni aba mi nja, en e jangpiny m’apidho an, ma tic m’i cinga, kara juyunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu ma nok bidoko rubanga, man ng’atu ma nyathigi bidoko thek ma tek: an, an a Yehova, abidhulo maeni i nindone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
